{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1382472,\"title\":\"Snow Angel of Revenge\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Traumatized Niina needs a change of scenery and a moment of escape from the world. Together with her friend Suvi, they rent a villa in the countryside. Soon the women find they are not welcome, and it doesn't help that they find themselves in the middle of fateful twists and turns and unwittingly become involved in a mysterious ancient cult. One night, a ragtag group of ancient pagan worshiping locals invade the villa to demand reparations for the women's actions and to perform their rituals. Having survived the atrocities, Niina begins to gather her strength with only one goal in mind - revenge!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p1BZi2mRZ3M4JBUJfGPFPFa2EN4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6LkCWqhugAH7ixBkeZussnw1a4S.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2024,\"runtime\":96,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FI\",\"name\":\"Finland\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Keke Soikkeli\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4330681,\"name\":\"Keke Soikkeli\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2J9nTSjtcgIHg2QajvowSnmyB6q.jpg\"},{\"id\":5039979,\"name\":\"Vivi Wahlström\",\"character\":\"Niina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yZOOMe7ARvQwCqI6goUpqkGvwHR.jpg\"},{\"id\":4261460,\"name\":\"Karoliina Tuominen\",\"character\":\"Suvi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pQNYf8ZQc8eG5ssKppep1rC1L1T.jpg\"},{\"id\":1771313,\"name\":\"Sara Chafak\",\"character\":\"Mimmi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sDb6uT2IoYiepcxEBt195ECwvSv.jpg\"},{\"id\":147768,\"name\":\"Hannele Lauri\",\"character\":\"Mama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h7xVLqw81UW77KQyPCJhj363aXJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1270217,\"name\":\"Konsta Hietanen\",\"character\":\"Mikko\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/