n elite military unit on a mission in the South American jungle encounters a deadly supernatural force revealing an ancient presence that continues to claim anyone who dares enter its domain.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1284046,\"title\":\"Onslaught\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAs7G3yFaULpfwfVdGvPo5HmFJS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pmPXXniQlb4EdYY0gVZO90rf54F.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a rogue squad of genetically engineered super soldiers break loose in the desert, a badass Army sniper must unleash hell to protect her young daughter.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9674,\"title\":\"Ring 0\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nuhEWlaoMD00rTDCiYxdEc7d1tD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/noRX8VyyAFK1tt0DQSq5qy1tE10.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Taking place thirty years before the events of Ringu, Ringu 0 provides the shocking background story of how the girl on the video became a deadly, vengeful spirit.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1233413,\"title\":\"Sinners\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fWPgbnt2LSqkQ6cdQc0SZN9CpLm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7KqDRzjbvIjDv7cdHz9G3ZYEQy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Trying to leave their troubled lives behind, twin brothers return to their hometown to start again, only to discover that an even greater evil is waiting to welcome them back.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":396535,\"title\":\"Train to Busan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vNVFt6dtcqnI7hqa6LFBUibuFiw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/brnfCYyz8EMbBrHgmh8sCwBi5i1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\